    "body": "@rashil2000 Sorry for the delay! I've made some notes on code (mostly just about me getting confused in a few years as to whether `cmd` means \"command\" or \"cmd.exe\"), but the code quality mostly seems fine.\r\n\r\nI think we need to decide what to do with that Transient Prompt section. I agree with @matchai that it shouldn't go into the advanced config doc as it is now, but I don't know if the answer is to create per-shell config guides, or to create a big Transient Prompt guide, or...something else. Would you be okay with holding onto the text for now? We could do a gist, a GitHub discussion, I'd even be okay with you removing it from this PR and opening a new PR with the text in there. Something while we work out the best structure for this.\r\n\r\nFinally, I want to actually test this out myself before giving final approval (hopefully relatively soon now that I've burned through some of my review backlog, but not quite tonight).",
